stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Blocked: policy limit<br/>(protected namespace, deny, min/max replicas)
  [*] --> Pending: autonomy approve<br/>(or auto with a precondition not observed)
  [*] --> Approved: autonomy observe,<br/>or auto with every precondition observed
  Pending --> Approved: a human sets decision=approve<br/>(not an agent, not the requester)
  Pending --> Denied: a human sets decision=deny
  Pending --> Expired: pendingTTL (1 h)
  Approved --> Executed: the identical change is admitted<br/>(or the executor spends the capability)
  Approved --> Expired: approvalTTL (10 min)
  Executed --> Executed: API server retry of the same write<br/>(identical object, same generation, ≤ 10 s, ≤ 5x) → readmitted
  Blocked --> [*]
  Denied --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]
  Executed --> [*]
